%% Tailwind v4 — full flow
%% Pure Mermaid. No Markdown fence.

flowchart TD
    trigger([Styling something, or adding a token]) --> cfg{Does a tailwind.config.* exist?}

    cfg -->|yes| migrate[Migrate it into CSS:<br/>content array to auto-detection + @source<br/>theme.extend to @theme<br/>darkMode:'class' to @custom-variant<br/>then DELETE the file]
    cfg -->|no| need

    migrate --> need{What is needed?}

    need -->|a value in a component| layer{Does a SEMANTIC token<br/>already name it?}
    need -->|a new token| where[Declare it in @theme,<br/>NOT :root]
    need -->|dark mode| dark["@custom-variant dark<br/>(&:where([data-theme=dark], [data-theme=dark] *))<br/>+ set the attribute PRE-PAINT in a head script"]
    need -->|a reusable utility| util["@utility — composes with variants;<br/>a plain .class does not"]

    layer -->|yes| use[Use it: bg-surface, text-muted]
    layer -->|no| add[ADD THE TOKEN.<br/>An arbitrary value like w-347px<br/>is a design-system failure, not a shortcut]
    add --> where

    where --> refs{Does the token reference<br/>another variable?}
    refs -->|yes| inline["@theme inline — or it resolves<br/>WRONG under nesting"]
    refs -->|no| plain[Plain @theme]

    inline --> verify
    plain --> verify
    use --> verify
    dark --> verify
    util --> verify

    verify{Does the utility actually emit CSS?}
    verify -->|no CSS at all| diag[Check, in order:<br/>1. token in :root instead of @theme<br/>2. class name built by string concatenation<br/>3. source file outside detection — add @source]
    diag --> verify
    verify -->|emits| grep{Arbitrary-value grep clean?<br/>No raw hex in components?}
    grep -->|findings| add
    grep -->|clean| done([Done: styled entirely from semantic tokens,<br/>both themes from one vocabulary])

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class cfg,need,layer,refs,verify,grep gate
    class trigger,done terminal
